---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for heyhido.com — how this personal blog handles data, analytics, and cookies."
>
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 min-h-[70vh]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This is the personal website of Hidayat Heydarov (Hido), published at
          <a href="https://heyhido.com" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">heyhido.com</a>.
          I use this site to publish essays about AI, product management, and technology. This page
          explains what data this site processes and how.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8">What I collect</h2>
        <p>
          I do not require an account and I do not ask you to submit personal information to read this
          blog. I do not sell, rent, or share any personal data with third parties for marketing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8">Analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses Google Analytics (tag G-V7JRDN5H5Y) to understand how many people visit and which
          pages are read. Google Analytics uses cookies and JavaScript that run in your browser and sends
          aggregated, pseudonymous usage data to Google. You can opt out of Google Analytics across the web
          using Google's
          <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">Analytics Opt-out browser add-on</a>,
          or by blocking cookies in your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8">Hosting and logs</h2>
        <p>
          This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like most web hosts, GitHub Pages may log standard technical
          information (such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested) to operate the service. Refer to
          <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">GitHub's privacy statement</a>
          for how they handle that data.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can clear your browser cookies at any time, which removes any analytics cookies placed by this
          site. For questions about this policy or the data processed by this site, contact
          <a href="mailto:ai@heyhido.com" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2">ai@heyhido.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-10">Last updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>